# UI resize capture: intentionally small window so overflow produces auto-hiding scrollbars.
seed 4242
physics off
text off
vsync off
water_hidden on
terrain_hidden on
frames 24
ui visible on
ui tab keys
ui rect 64 70 430 280
ui blur on
ui renderer_combo closed
ui profiler_expand none
ui_test_pattern on
screenshot Profile/ui_small_scroll.bmp frame 20

camera main 500 60 650  600 33 600  0 1 0
